WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.742
Put $100 away at three steady rates.

2
00:00:04.042 --> 00:00:06.350
10%, 7% and 3% a year.

3
00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:09.408
After five years they are close.

4
00:00:09.708 --> 00:00:12.015
After fifteen years the gap opens:

5
00:00:12.015 --> 00:00:14.304
$418, $276 and $156.

6
00:00:14.604 --> 00:00:17.296
Each year's gain earns a return of

7
00:00:17.296 --> 00:00:19.219
its own the next year,

8
00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:21.892
so the lines bend upward.

9
00:00:22.192 --> 00:00:23.346
By year thirty:

10
00:00:23.346 --> 00:00:25.250
$1,745 against $243.

11
00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:28.242
A few points a year became more

12
00:00:28.242 --> 00:00:30.915
than seven times the money.

13
00:00:31.215 --> 00:00:33.908
So compare returns over the same dates,

14
00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:37.596
from the same start.
